WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue {
    color: white;
    background-color: #383943A3;
}

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.360
Welcome to The Teatime Shift.

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:07.240
For the next fifteen minutes, you're going to lead
a real teatime at a care home, supporting a man called

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:09.156
Daniel through his meal, on your own.

00:00:09.306 --> 00:00:12.586
There are no hints, and no single right answer.

00:00:12.586 --> 00:00:15.466
What happens is whatever your choices make happen.

00:00:15.466 --> 00:00:18.849
Nothing about this shift looks dramatic, and that
is exactly the point.

00:00:18.999 --> 00:00:23.959
This is how real practice feels, and it is where real
judgement is made.

00:00:23.959 --> 00:00:25.687
When you're ready, begin your shift.